# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This section of the lesson explains the *phase estimation problem*.\n"
"We'll begin with a short discussion of the *spectral theorem* from linear algebra, and then move on to a statement of the phase estimation problem itself.\n"
msgstr ""
"يشرح هذا القسم من الدرس *مسألة تقدير الطور*. سنبدأ بمناقشة موجزة لـ*مبرهنة "
"الطيف* من الجبر الخطي، ثم ننتقل إلى صياغة مسألة تقدير الطور.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Spectral theorem {#spectral-theorem}"
msgstr "مبرهنة الطيف {#spectral-theorem}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The *spectral theorem* is an important fact from linear algebra that states that matrices of a certain type, called *normal matrices,* can be expressed in a simple and useful way.\n"
"We'll only need this theorem for unitary matrices in this lesson, but down the road in this series we'll apply it to Hermitian matrices as well.\n"
msgstr ""
"*مبرهنة الطيف* حقيقة مهمة من الجبر الخطي تنص على أن المصفوفات من نوع معين، "
"تُسمّى *المصفوفات الطبيعية*، يمكن التعبير عنها بطريقة بسيطة ومفيدة. سنحتاج "
"إلى هذه المبرهنة فقط للمصفوفات الأحادية في هذا الدرس، لكننا سنطبّقها لاحقًا "
"في هذه السلسلة على المصفوفات الإرميتية أيضًا.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Normal matrices {#normal-matrices}"
msgstr "المصفوفات الطبيعية {#normal-matrices}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A square matrix $M$ with complex number entries is said to be a *normal* matrix if it commutes with its conjugate transpose:\n"
"$M M^{\\dagger} = M^{\\dagger} M.$\n"
msgstr ""
"يُقال إن مصفوفة مربعة $M$ بعناصر من الأعداد المركّبة هي *مصفوفة طبيعية* إذا كانت تُبادل مرافقها التحويلي:\n"
"$M M^{\\dagger} = M^{\\dagger} M.$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Every unitary matrix $U$ is normal because\n"
msgstr "كل مصفوفة أحادية $U$ طبيعية لأن\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"U U^{\\dagger} = \\mathbb{I} = U^{\\dagger} U.\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"U U^{\\dagger} = \\mathbb{I} = U^{\\dagger} U.\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Hermitian matrices, which are matrices that equal their own conjugate transpose, are another important class of normal matrices.\n"
"If $H$ is a Hermitian matrix, then\n"
msgstr ""
"المصفوفات الإرميتية، وهي المصفوفات التي تساوي مرافقها التحويلي، هي فئة أخرى "
"مهمة من المصفوفات الطبيعية. إذا كانت $H$ مصفوفة إرميتية، فإن\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"H H^{\\dagger} = H^2 = H^{\\dagger} H,\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"H H^{\\dagger} = H^2 = H^{\\dagger} H,\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "so $H$ is normal.\n"
msgstr "وبالتالي فإن $H$ طبيعية.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Not every square matrix is normal.\n"
"For instance, this matrix isn't normal:\n"
msgstr "ليست كل مصفوفة مربعة طبيعية. فمثلًا، هذه المصفوفة ليست طبيعية:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"0 & 1\\\\\n"
"0 & 0\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"0 & 1\\\\\n"
"0 & 0\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(This is a simple but great example of a matrix that's often very helpful to consider.)\n"
"It isn't normal because\n"
msgstr ""
"(هذا مثال بسيط لكنه رائع لمصفوفة كثيرًا ما يكون من المفيد أخذها بالاعتبار.)\n"
"ليست طبيعية لأن\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"0 & 1\\\\\n"
"0 & 0\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"0 & 1\\\\\n"
"0 & 0\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}^{\\dagger}\n"
"=\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"0 & 1\\\\\n"
"0 & 0\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"0 & 1\\\\\n"
"0 & 0\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}^{\\dagger}\n"
"=\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"0 & 1\\\\\n"
"0 & 0\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"0 & 0\\\\\n"
"1 & 0\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"=\n"
msgstr ""
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"0 & 1\\\\\n"
"0 & 0\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"0 & 0\\\\\n"
"1 & 0\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"=\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"1 & 0\\\\\n"
"0 & 0\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"1 & 0\\\\\n"
"0 & 0\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "while\n"
msgstr "بينما\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"0 & 1\\\\\n"
"0 & 0\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}^{\\dagger}\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"0 & 1\\\\\n"
"0 & 0\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"=\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"0 & 1\\\\\n"
"0 & 0\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}^{\\dagger}\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"0 & 1\\\\\n"
"0 & 0\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"=\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"0 & 0\\\\\n"
"1 & 0\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"0 & 1\\\\\n"
"0 & 0\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"=\n"
msgstr ""
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"0 & 0\\\\\n"
"1 & 0\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"0 & 1\\\\\n"
"0 & 0\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"=\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"0 & 0\\\\\n"
"0 & 1\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}.\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"0 & 0\\\\\n"
"0 & 1\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}.\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Theorem statement {#theorem-statement}"
msgstr "صياغة المبرهنة {#theorem-statement}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Now here's a statement of the spectral theorem.\n"
msgstr "الآن إليك صياغة مبرهنة الطيف.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Figure title=\"Theorem\">\n"
"Spectral theorem: Let $M$ be a normal $N\\times N$ complex matrix.\n"
"There exists an orthonormal basis of $N$-dimensional complex vectors $\\bigl\\{ \\vert\\psi_1\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert\\psi_N\\rangle \\bigr\\}$ along with complex numbers $\\lambda_1,\\ldots,\\lambda_N$ such that\n"
"$$\n"
"M = \\lambda_1 \\vert \\psi_1\\rangle\\langle \\psi_1\\vert + \\cdots + \\lambda_N \\vert \\psi_N\\rangle\\langle \\psi_N\\vert.\n"
"$$\n"
"</Figure>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Figure title=\"مبرهنة\">\n"
"مبرهنة الطيف: لتكن $M$ مصفوفة مركّبة طبيعية بأبعاد $N\\times N$.\n"
"توجد قاعدة متعامدة معيارية من المتجهات المركّبة ذات الـ$N$ بُعدًا $\\bigl\\{ \\vert\\psi_1\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert\\psi_N\\rangle \\bigr\\}$ مع أعداد مركّبة $\\lambda_1,\\ldots,\\lambda_N$ بحيث\n"
"$$\n"
"M = \\lambda_1 \\vert \\psi_1\\rangle\\langle \\psi_1\\vert + \\cdots + \\lambda_N \\vert \\psi_N\\rangle\\langle \\psi_N\\vert.\n"
"$$\n"
"</Figure>\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "The expression of a matrix in the form\n"
msgstr "يُسمّى التعبير عن مصفوفة بالشكل\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"M = \\sum_{k = 1}^N \\lambda_k \\vert \\psi_k\\rangle\\langle \\psi_k\\vert \\tag{1}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"M = \\sum_{k = 1}^N \\lambda_k \\vert \\psi_k\\rangle\\langle \\psi_k\\vert \\tag{1}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"is commonly called a *spectral decomposition*.\n"
"Notice that if $M$ is a normal matrix expressed in the form $(1),$ then the equation\n"
msgstr ""
"عادةً *التحليل الطيفي*.\n"
"لاحظ أنه إذا كانت $M$ مصفوفة طبيعية معبَّرًا عنها بالشكل $(1)$، فإن المعادلة\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"M \\vert \\psi_j \\rangle = \\lambda_j \\vert \\psi_j \\rangle\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"M \\vert \\psi_j \\rangle = \\lambda_j \\vert \\psi_j \\rangle\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"must be true for every $j = 1,\\ldots,N.$\n"
"This is a consequence of the fact that $\\bigl\\{ \\vert\\psi_1\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert\\psi_N\\rangle \\bigr\\}$ is orthonormal:\n"
msgstr ""
"يجب أن تكون صحيحة لكل $j = 1,\\ldots,N$.\n"
"هذا نتيجة لكون $\\bigl\\{ \\vert\\psi_1\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert\\psi_N\\rangle \\bigr\\}$ متعامدة معيارية:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"M \\vert \\psi_j \\rangle\n"
"= \\left(\\sum_{k = 1}^N \\lambda_k \\vert \\psi_k\\rangle\\langle \\psi_k\\vert\\right)\\vert \\psi_j\\rangle\n"
"= \\sum_{k = 1}^N \\lambda_k \\vert \\psi_k\\rangle\\langle \\psi_k\\vert\\psi_j \\rangle\n"
"= \\lambda_j \\vert\\psi_j \\rangle\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"M \\vert \\psi_j \\rangle\n"
"= \\left(\\sum_{k = 1}^N \\lambda_k \\vert \\psi_k\\rangle\\langle \\psi_k\\vert\\right)\\vert \\psi_j\\rangle\n"
"= \\sum_{k = 1}^N \\lambda_k \\vert \\psi_k\\rangle\\langle \\psi_k\\vert\\psi_j \\rangle\n"
"= \\lambda_j \\vert\\psi_j \\rangle\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"That is, each number $\\lambda_j$ is an *eigenvalue* of $M$ and "
"$\\vert\\psi_j\\rangle$ is an *eigenvector* corresponding to that "
"eigenvalue.\n"
msgstr ""
"أي أن كل عدد $\\lambda_j$ هو *قيمة ذاتية* لـ$M$ وأن $\\vert\\psi_j\\rangle$ "
"هو *متجه ذاتي* يقابل تلك القيمة الذاتية.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Example 1**.\n"
"Let\n"
"$$\n"
"\\mathbb{I} = \\begin{pmatrix}1 & 0\\\\0 & 1\\end{pmatrix},\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"**مثال 1**.\n"
"لتكن\n"
"$$\n"
"\\mathbb{I} = \\begin{pmatrix}1 & 0\\\\0 & 1\\end{pmatrix},\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  which is normal.\n"
"  The theorem implies that $\\mathbb{I}$ can be written in the form $(1)$ for some choice of $\\lambda_1,$ $\\lambda_2,$ $\\vert\\psi_1\\rangle,$ and $\\vert\\psi_2\\rangle.$\n"
"  There are multiple choices that work, including\n"
msgstr ""
"  وهي طبيعية.\n"
"  تستلزم المبرهنة أنه يمكن كتابة $\\mathbb{I}$ بالشكل $(1)$ لاختيار ما من $\\lambda_1,$ $\\lambda_2,$ $\\vert\\psi_1\\rangle,$ و$\\vert\\psi_2\\rangle.$\n"
"  هناك اختيارات متعددة صالحة، منها\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  $$\n"
"  \\lambda_1 = 1, \\hspace{5pt}\n"
"  \\lambda_2 = 1, \\hspace{5pt}\n"
"  \\vert\\psi_1\\rangle = \\vert 0\\rangle, \\hspace{5pt}\n"
"  \\vert\\psi_2\\rangle = \\vert 1\\rangle.\n"
"  $$\n"
msgstr ""
"  $$\n"
"  \\lambda_1 = 1, \\hspace{5pt}\n"
"  \\lambda_2 = 1, \\hspace{5pt}\n"
"  \\vert\\psi_1\\rangle = \\vert 0\\rangle, \\hspace{5pt}\n"
"  \\vert\\psi_2\\rangle = \\vert 1\\rangle.\n"
"  $$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  Notice that the theorem does not say that the complex numbers $\\lambda_1,\\ldots,\\lambda_N$ are\n"
"  distinct — we can have the same complex number repeated, which is necessary for this example.\n"
"  These choices work because\n"
"  $$\n"
"  \\mathbb{I} = \\vert 0\\rangle\\langle 0\\vert + \\vert 1\\rangle\\langle 1\\vert.\n"
"  $$\n"
msgstr ""
"  لاحظ أن المبرهنة لا تشترط أن تكون الأعداد المركّبة $\\lambda_1,\\ldots,\\lambda_N$ مختلفة — يمكن تكرار نفس العدد المركّب، وهو ضروري لهذا المثال.\n"
"  تصلح هذه الاختيارات لأن\n"
"  $$\n"
"  \\mathbb{I} = \\vert 0\\rangle\\langle 0\\vert + \\vert 1\\rangle\\langle 1\\vert.\n"
"  $$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  Indeed, we could choose $\\{\\vert\\psi_1\\rangle,\\vert\\psi_2\\rangle\\}$ to be *any* orthonormal basis and the\n"
"  equation will be true. For instance,\n"
msgstr ""
"  في الواقع، يمكن اختيار $\\{\\vert\\psi_1\\rangle,\\vert\\psi_2\\rangle\\}$"
" لتكون *أي* قاعدة متعامدة معيارية وستكون المعادلة صحيحة. فمثلًا،\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  $$\n"
"  \\mathbb{I} = \\vert +\\rangle\\langle +\\vert + \\vert -\\rangle\\langle -\\vert.\n"
"  $$\n"
msgstr ""
"  $$\n"
"  \\mathbb{I} = \\vert +\\rangle\\langle +\\vert + \\vert -\\rangle\\langle -\\vert.\n"
"  $$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Example 2**.\n"
"Consider a Hadamard operation.\n"
msgstr ""
"**مثال 2**.\n"
"لنتأمل عملية هادامار.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  $$\n"
"  H = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\n"
"  \\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"  1 & 1\\\\[1mm]\n"
"  1 & -1\n"
"  \\end{pmatrix}\n"
"  $$\n"
msgstr ""
"  $$\n"
"  H = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\n"
"  \\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"  1 & 1\\\\[1mm]\n"
"  1 & -1\n"
"  \\end{pmatrix}\n"
"  $$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  This is a unitary matrix, so it is normal. The spectral theorem implies that $H$ can be written in the\n"
"  form $(1),$ and in particular we have\n"
msgstr ""
"  هذه مصفوفة أحادية وبالتالي طبيعية. تستلزم مبرهنة الطيف أنه يمكن كتابة $H$ "
"بالشكل $(1)$، وبالتحديد لدينا\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  $$\n"
"  H =\n"
"  \\vert\\psi_{\\pi/8}\\rangle \\langle \\psi_{\\pi/8}\\vert\n"
"  - \\vert\\psi_{5\\pi/8}\\rangle \\langle \\psi_{5\\pi/8}\\vert\n"
"  $$\n"
msgstr ""
"  $$\n"
"  H =\n"
"  \\vert\\psi_{\\pi/8}\\rangle \\langle \\psi_{\\pi/8}\\vert\n"
"  - \\vert\\psi_{5\\pi/8}\\rangle \\langle \\psi_{5\\pi/8}\\vert\n"
"  $$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "  where\n"
msgstr "  حيث\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  $$\n"
"  \\vert\\psi_{\\theta}\\rangle\n"
"  = \\cos(\\theta)\\vert 0\\rangle + \\sin(\\theta) \\vert 1\\rangle.\n"
"  $$\n"
msgstr ""
"  $$\n"
"  \\vert\\psi_{\\theta}\\rangle\n"
"  = \\cos(\\theta)\\vert 0\\rangle + \\sin(\\theta) \\vert 1\\rangle.\n"
"  $$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "  More explicitly,\n"
msgstr "  بشكل أكثر صراحة،\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  $$\n"
"  \\begin{aligned}\n"
"  \\vert\\psi_{\\pi/8}\\rangle & = \\frac{\\sqrt{2 + \\sqrt{2}}}{2}\\vert 0\\rangle\n"
"  + \\frac{\\sqrt{2 - \\sqrt{2}}}{2}\\vert 1\\rangle, \\\\[3mm]\n"
"  \\vert\\psi_{5\\pi/8}\\rangle & = -\\frac{\\sqrt{2 - \\sqrt{2}}}{2}\\vert 0\\rangle\n"
"  + \\frac{\\sqrt{2 + \\sqrt{2}}}{2}\\vert 1\\rangle.\n"
"  \\end{aligned}\n"
"  $$\n"
msgstr ""
"  $$\n"
"  \\begin{aligned}\n"
"  \\vert\\psi_{\\pi/8}\\rangle & = \\frac{\\sqrt{2 + \\sqrt{2}}}{2}\\vert 0\\rangle\n"
"  + \\frac{\\sqrt{2 - \\sqrt{2}}}{2}\\vert 1\\rangle, \\\\[3mm]\n"
"  \\vert\\psi_{5\\pi/8}\\rangle & = -\\frac{\\sqrt{2 - \\sqrt{2}}}{2}\\vert 0\\rangle\n"
"  + \\frac{\\sqrt{2 + \\sqrt{2}}}{2}\\vert 1\\rangle.\n"
"  \\end{aligned}\n"
"  $$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  We can check that this decomposition is correct by performing the required"
" calculations:\n"
msgstr "  يمكن التحقق من صحة هذا التحليل بإجراء الحسابات المطلوبة:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  $$\n"
"  \\vert\\psi_{\\pi/8}\\rangle \\langle \\psi_{\\pi/8}\\vert\n"
"  - \\vert\\psi_{5\\pi/8}\\rangle \\langle \\psi_{5\\pi/8}\\vert\n"
"  = \\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"  \\frac{2 + \\sqrt{2}}{4} & \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{4}\\\\[2mm]\n"
"  \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{4} & \\frac{2 - \\sqrt{2}}{4}\n"
"  \\end{pmatrix}\n"
"  -\n"
"  \\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"  \\frac{2 - \\sqrt{2}}{4} & -\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{4}\\\\[2mm]\n"
"  -\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{4} & \\frac{2 + \\sqrt{2}}{4}\n"
"  \\end{pmatrix}\n"
"  = H.\n"
"  $$\n"
msgstr ""
"  $$\n"
"  \\vert\\psi_{\\pi/8}\\rangle \\langle \\psi_{\\pi/8}\\vert\n"
"  - \\vert\\psi_{5\\pi/8}\\rangle \\langle \\psi_{5\\pi/8}\\vert\n"
"  = \\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"  \\frac{2 + \\sqrt{2}}{4} & \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{4}\\\\[2mm]\n"
"  \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{4} & \\frac{2 - \\sqrt{2}}{4}\n"
"  \\end{pmatrix}\n"
"  -\n"
"  \\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"  \\frac{2 - \\sqrt{2}}{4} & -\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{4}\\\\[2mm]\n"
"  -\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{4} & \\frac{2 + \\sqrt{2}}{4}\n"
"  \\end{pmatrix}\n"
"  = H.\n"
"  $$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"As the first example above reveals, there can be some freedom in how eigenvectors are selected.\n"
"There is, however, no freedom at all in how the eigenvalues are chosen, except for their ordering:\n"
"the same $N$ complex numbers $\\lambda_1,\\ldots,\\lambda_N,$ which can include repetitions of the same complex number, will always occur in the equation $(1)$ for a given choice of a matrix $M.$\n"
msgstr ""
"كما يكشف المثال الأول أعلاه، قد تكون هناك درجة من الحرية في اختيار المتجهات "
"الذاتية. غير أنه لا توجد أي حرية في اختيار القيم الذاتية، باستثناء ترتيبها: "
"نفس الأعداد المركّبة الـ$N$ وهي $\\lambda_1,\\ldots,\\lambda_N$ التي يمكن أن"
" تتضمن تكرارات لنفس العدد المركّب، ستظهر دائمًا في المعادلة $(1)$ لاختيار "
"معين للمصفوفة $M$.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Now let's focus in on unitary matrices.\n"
"Suppose we have a complex number $\\lambda$ and a non-zero vector $\\vert\\psi\\rangle$ that satisfy the equation\n"
msgstr ""
"الآن لنركّز على المصفوفات الأحادية. لنفترض أن لدينا عددًا مركّبًا $\\lambda$"
" ومتجهًا غير صفري $\\vert\\psi\\rangle$ يحققان المعادلة\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"U\\vert\\psi\\rangle = \\lambda\\vert\\psi\\rangle.\n"
"\\tag{2}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"U\\vert\\psi\\rangle = \\lambda\\vert\\psi\\rangle.\n"
"\\tag{2}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"That is, $\\lambda$ is an eigenvalue of $U$ and $\\vert\\psi\\rangle$ is an "
"eigenvector corresponding to this eigenvalue.\n"
msgstr ""
"أي أن $\\lambda$ قيمة ذاتية لـ$U$ وأن $\\vert\\psi\\rangle$ متجه ذاتي يقابل "
"هذه القيمة الذاتية.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Unitary matrices preserve Euclidean norm, and so we conclude the following "
"from $(2).$\n"
msgstr ""
"المصفوفات الأحادية تحافظ على المعيار الإقليدي، ومن ثمَّ نستنتج التالي من "
"$(2)$.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\bigl\\| \\vert\\psi\\rangle \\bigr\\|\n"
"= \\bigl\\| U \\vert\\psi\\rangle \\bigr\\|\n"
"= \\bigl\\| \\lambda \\vert\\psi\\rangle \\bigr\\|\n"
"= \\vert \\lambda \\vert \\bigl\\| \\vert\\psi\\rangle \\bigr\\|\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\bigl\\| \\vert\\psi\\rangle \\bigr\\|\n"
"= \\bigl\\| U \\vert\\psi\\rangle \\bigr\\|\n"
"= \\bigl\\| \\lambda \\vert\\psi\\rangle \\bigr\\|\n"
"= \\vert \\lambda \\vert \\bigl\\| \\vert\\psi\\rangle \\bigr\\|\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The condition that $\\vert\\psi\\rangle$ is non-zero implies that $\\bigl\\|"
" \\vert\\psi\\rangle \\bigr\\|\\neq 0,$ so we can cancel it from both sides "
"to obtain\n"
msgstr ""
"شرط أن $\\vert\\psi\\rangle$ غير صفري يستلزم $\\bigl\\| \\vert\\psi\\rangle "
"\\bigr\\|\\neq 0$، فيمكننا حذفه من الطرفين للحصول على\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert \\lambda \\vert = 1.\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert \\lambda \\vert = 1.\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This reveals that eigenvalues of unitary matrices must always have absolute "
"value equal to one, so they lie on the *unit circle.*\n"
msgstr ""
"هذا يكشف أن القيم الذاتية للمصفوفات الأحادية يجب أن تكون دائمًا قيمتها "
"المطلقة مساوية للواحد، أي أنها تقع على *الدائرة الوحدة*.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\mathbb{T} = \\{\\alpha\\in\\mathbb{C} : \\vert\\alpha\\vert = 1\\}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\mathbb{T} = \\{\\alpha\\in\\mathbb{C} : \\vert\\alpha\\vert = 1\\}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(The symbol $\\mathbb{T}$ is a common name for the complex unit circle. The "
"name $S^1$ is also common.)\n"
msgstr ""
"(الرمز $\\mathbb{T}$ اسم شائع للدائرة الوحدة المركّبة. الاسم $S^1$ شائع "
"أيضًا.)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Phase estimation problem statement {#phase-estimation-problem-statement}"
msgstr "صياغة مسألة تقدير الطور {#phase-estimation-problem-statement}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In the *phase estimation problem*, we're given a quantum state $\\vert \\psi\\rangle$ of $n$ qubits, along with a unitary quantum circuit that acts on $n$ qubits.\n"
"We're *promised* that $\\vert \\psi\\rangle$ is an eigenvector of the unitary matrix $U$ that describes the action of the circuit, and our goal is to compute or approximate the eigenvalue $\\lambda$ to which $\\vert \\psi\\rangle$ corresponds.\n"
"More precisely, because $\\lambda$ lies on the complex unit circle, we can write\n"
msgstr ""
"في *مسألة تقدير الطور*، تُعطى لنا حالة كمومية $\\vert \\psi\\rangle$ من $n$ "
"كيوبت، مع دائرة كمومية أحادية تعمل على $n$ كيوبت. *يُعدنا* بأن $\\vert "
"\\psi\\rangle$ متجه ذاتي للمصفوفة الأحادية $U$ التي تصف عمل الدائرة، وهدفنا "
"هو حساب أو تقريب القيمة الذاتية $\\lambda$ التي تقابلها $\\vert "
"\\psi\\rangle$. بتحديد أكثر، بما أن $\\lambda$ تقع على دائرة الوحدة "
"المركّبة، يمكننا كتابة\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\lambda = e^{2\\pi i \\theta}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\lambda = e^{2\\pi i \\theta}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"for a unique real number $\\theta$ satisfying $0\\leq\\theta<1.$\n"
"The goal of the problem is to compute or approximate this real number $\\theta.$\n"
msgstr ""
"لعدد حقيقي فريد $\\theta$ يحقق $0\\leq\\theta<1$. هدف المسألة هو حساب أو "
"تقريب هذا العدد الحقيقي $\\theta$.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Figure title=\"Phase estimation problem\">\n"
"Input: A unitary quantum circuit for an $n$-qubit operation $U$ along with an $n$-qubit quantum state $\\vert\\psi\\rangle$ \\\n"
"Promise: $\\vert\\psi\\rangle$ is an eigenvector of $U$ \\\n"
"Output: an approximation to the number $\\theta\\in[0,1)$ satisfying $U\\vert\\psi\\rangle = e^{2\\pi i \\theta}\\vert\\psi\\rangle$\n"
"</Figure>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Figure title=\"مسألة تقدير الطور\">\n"
"المدخل: دائرة كمومية أحادية لعملية $U$ على $n$ كيوبت مع حالة كمومية $\\vert\\psi\\rangle$ من $n$ كيوبت \\\n"
"الوعد: $\\vert\\psi\\rangle$ متجه ذاتي لـ$U$ \\\n"
"المخرج: تقريب للعدد $\\theta\\in[0,1)$ الذي يحقق $U\\vert\\psi\\rangle = e^{2\\pi i \\theta}\\vert\\psi\\rangle$\n"
"</Figure>\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Here are a few remarks about this problem statement:\n"
msgstr "إليك بعض الملاحظات حول هذه الصياغة:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The phase estimation problem is different from other problems we've seen so "
"far in the course in that the input includes a quantum state. Typically we "
"focus on problems having classical inputs and outputs, but nothing prevents "
"us from considering quantum state inputs like this. In terms of its "
"practical relevance, the phase estimation problem is typically encountered "
"as a *subproblem* inside of a larger computation, like we'll see in the "
"context of integer factorization later in the lesson.\n"
msgstr ""
"مسألة تقدير الطور تختلف عن المسائل الأخرى التي رأيناها حتى الآن في الدورة في"
" أن المدخل يتضمن حالة كمومية. عادةً ما نركّز على المسائل ذات المدخلات "
"والمخرجات الكلاسيكية، لكن لا شيء يمنعنا من النظر في مدخلات من حالات كمومية "
"كهذه. من حيث أهميتها العملية، عادةً ما تُقابل مسألة تقدير الطور كـ*مسألة "
"فرعية* داخل حساب أكبر، كما سنرى في سياق تحليل الأعداد الصحيحة لاحقًا في "
"الدرس.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The statement of the phase estimation problem above isn't specific about "
"what constitutes an approximation of $\\theta,$ but we can formulate more "
"precise problem statements depending on our needs and interests. In the "
"context of integer factorization, we'll demand a very precise approximation "
"to $\\theta,$ but in other cases we might be satisfied with a very rough "
"approximation. We'll discuss shortly how the precision we require affects "
"the computational cost of a solution.\n"
msgstr ""
"صياغة مسألة تقدير الطور أعلاه لا تحدد ما يُشكّل تقريبًا للـ$\\theta$، لكن "
"يمكننا صياغة مسائل أكثر دقة بحسب احتياجاتنا واهتماماتنا. في سياق تحليل "
"الأعداد الصحيحة، سنطلب تقريبًا دقيقًا للغاية لـ$\\theta$، لكن في حالات أخرى "
"قد نكتفي بتقريب خشن جدًا. سنناقش قريبًا كيف تؤثر الدقة المطلوبة في التكلفة "
"الحسابية للحل.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Notice that as we go from $\\theta = 0$ toward $\\theta = 1$ in the phase "
"estimation problem, we're going all the way around the unit circle, starting"
" from $e^{2\\pi i \\cdot 0} = 1$ and moving counter-clockwise toward "
"$e^{2\\pi i \\cdot 1} = 1.$ That is, when we reach $\\theta = 1$ we're back "
"where we started at $\\theta = 0.$ So, as we consider the accuracy of "
"approximations, choices of $\\theta$ near $1$ should be considered as being "
"near $0.$ For example, an approximation $\\theta = 0.999$ should be "
"considered as being within $1/1000$ of $\\theta = 0.$\n"
msgstr ""
"لاحظ أننا حين نسير من $\\theta = 0$ نحو $\\theta = 1$ في مسألة تقدير الطور، "
"نقطع دائرة الوحدة كاملةً، بدءًا من $e^{2\\pi i \\cdot 0} = 1$ متحركين عكس "
"عقارب الساعة نحو $e^{2\\pi i \\cdot 1} = 1$. أي أننا حين نصل إلى $\\theta = "
"1$ نكون عدنا إلى نقطة البداية $\\theta = 0$. لذا، عند النظر في دقة "
"التقريبات، يجب اعتبار قيم $\\theta$ القريبة من $1$ قريبةً من $0$. فمثلًا، "
"يجب اعتبار التقريب $\\theta = 0.999$ ضمن $1/1000$ من $\\theta = 0$.\n"
